<title>ITALY: TENNIS-SICILIAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SICILIAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PALERMO, Sicily 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sicilian international championship results on Thursday:</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>Johan Van Herk (Belgium) beat Felix Mantilla (Spain) 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat Hernan Gumy (Argentina) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Karim Alami (Morocco) beat Carlos Moya (Spain) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Jordi Burillo (Spain) beat Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) 7-5 2-6</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Francisco Clavet (Spain) beat Fernando Meligeni (Brazil) 4-6</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5) 6-3</p>
</text>
